* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.gb text
*.fasta text

# The malformed-input fuzz corpus is bytes, not text: several fixtures exist
# precisely to carry CRLF, lone CR, NUL bytes, UTF-16 or binary garbage, and
# git's eol=lf normalization silently rewrites them into a different file than
# the one the tests were written against (MEASURED 2026-09-19: a CRLF fixture
# was committed with its CRLFs already stripped).
worker/tests/data/malformed/** -text
